  "body": " A unity gain Sallen-Key low-pass filter circuit.   Circuit with six nodes consisting of voltage source Vin, resistors R1 and R2, capacitors C1 and C2, and a short. The high-potential end of Vin connects to R1 at node a. R1, R2, and C1 connect at node b. R2, C2, and the non-inverting input of the op-amp connect at node c. The short connects to the inverting input of the op-amp at node d. C1, the short, and the output of the op-amp connect at node e. The low-potential end of Vin and C2 connect at node f. Voltage Vout drops from node e to node f.    "
